---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Base title={"Group Therapy in Utah | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Group therapy in Provo, Orem, & Sandy, Utah. Connect with others navigating similar challenges in a safe, therapist-led setting. Book a free 15-min consult."}>
<section class="sec t-black h-medium has-bg has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-bg"><img src="/images/tangible-47-9c7b1b.jpg" alt="" style="object-position:48% 30%" loading="eager"><div class="sec-ov" style="opacity:0.5"></div></div><div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:7;--mrows:9">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/5/6/23;--m:1/2/6/10"><div class="rte"><h1 class="ta-center">Group Therapy</h1><p class="lg ta-center">Find connection, feel understood, and grow alongside others who get it.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:6/10/8/18;--m:6/2/8/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="tel:4352828086">Start Group Therapy Today</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#fff" /></section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:14;--mrows:22">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/14/14/26;--m:14/2/22/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/group-therapy-tangible-a8fad9.jpg" alt="A group of young people sit in a circle for a group therapy session at Tangible Therapy in Orem Utah." width="2500" height="1575" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/5/12;--m:2/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>You Don't Have to Heal Alone</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/2/13/12;--m:4/2/14/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>There's something powerful about being in a room, or a Zoom call, with people who truly understand what you're going through. Not because you explained it to them, but because they've lived it too.</p><p>Group therapy at Tangible brings together small groups of people navigating similar challenges, guided by a licensed therapist who keeps the space safe, focused, and genuinely helpful. It's therapy, just with the added support of people who get it.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:20;--mrows:31">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/10/3/18;--m:1/2/3/10;--dz:6;--mz:6"><div class="rte"><div class="scaled"><span class="scaled-in"><h2>Current Groups</h2></span></div></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:5/4/21/12;--m:3/2/16/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:30px"><img src="/images/other-side-of-the-closet-517723.jpg" alt="A poster for a therapy group titled &quot;the other side of the closet&quot;. A therapy group for parents and family members of LGBTQ+ people. The poster is colorful and shows two therapists Kade Cope and Leah Brown of Tangible Therapy." width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-shape jc" style="--d:5/15/21/23;--m:16/2/32/10"><div class="shape" style="background:hsla(44, 29%, 80%, 1);border-radius:30px"></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html inset-m" style="--d:6/15/9/23;--m:17/2/19/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-accent">The Other Side of the Closet</span></h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:9/16/15/22;--m:19/3/26/9;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-accent">When: The 1st and 3rd Thursdays of each month</span></p><p><span class="c-accent">Cost: 30$ Session (eligible for insurance)</span></p><p><span class="c-accent">Where: 230 N Orem Blvd. Orem UT 84057</span></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:15/16/17/22;--m:26/3/28/9;--dz:5;--mz:5"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="tel:4352605406">Call to sign up today!</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:17/16/19/22;--m:28/3/30/9;--dz:6;--mz:6"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="sms:4352828086">Text to sign up today!</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:24">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/2/13/12;--m:17/2/24/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:40px"><img src="/images/tangible-group-6dca1a.jpg" alt="A group of young people sit in a circle in a brightly lit room for a group therapy session at Tangible Therapy." width="3300" height="2550" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/15/3/25;--m:2/2/3/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>A Different Kind of Support</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/15/12/25;--m:3/2/16/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Sometimes the most healing thing isn't advice, it's realizing you're not the only one. Group therapy has a way of doing that, without you even expecting it.</p><p>You'll still get professional clinical guidance every session. But you'll also gain something individual therapy can't replicate: the lived experience of others, the relief of being understood, and the momentum that comes from growing alongside people on a similar path.</p><p>All groups at Tangible are facilitated by licensed therapists and kept small enough that you won't get lost in the crowd.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top:6.6vmax;padding-bottom:6.6vmax">
<div class="wrap"><div class="list-title rte"><p>What you’ll get</p></div><ul class="ulist ulist-carousel" style="--per:3;--ar:3/2;--tfs:calc((2.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--bfs:calc((1.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--cw:75%;--gap:20px"><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="#" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>50-minute sessions led by a licensed Utah therapist</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>A small, confidential group of people navigating similar challenges</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Evidence-based skills you can use between sessions</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>A non-judgmental space where every voice matters</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Fresh perspective from others who truly understand</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="/" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>A lower-cost alternative to individual therapy, without sacrificing quality</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="carousel-nav"><button class="prev" aria-label="Previous"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m6-6-6 6 6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><button class="next" aria-label="Next"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button></div></div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#565d57" /></section>

<section class="sec t-light h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/2/4/26;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">✺ Frequently asked questions ✺</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/2/14/13;--m:5/2/13/10"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>What kinds of groups do you offer?</summary><div class="rte"><p>We try to keep the groups we offer updated, but group offerings change based on therapist availability and demand. Contact us to ask what's currently open.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is group therapy as effective as individual therapy?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Research consistently shows group therapy is just as effective as individual therapy for many challenges, and in some cases, more so, because the group dynamic itself becomes part of the healing. Many clients do both at the same time.</p></div></details><details><summary>Will I have to share personal things in front of strangers?</summary><div class="rte"><p>You share at your own pace. A good group therapist never forces disclosure. Most people find that after the first session or two, the group stops feeling like strangers pretty quickly.</p></div></details></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/15/10/26;--m:13/2/21/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>How do I know if group therapy is right for me?</summary><div class="rte"><p>If you're dealing with difficult challenges and feeling like no one understands group therapy might be worth exploring. We're happy to chat through it, book a free 15-minute consult and we'll help you figure out if a group is a good fit.</p></div></details><details><summary>What&#x27;s the cost for Group Therapy?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Group therapy is typically covered by insurance which helps keep group therapy extremely affordable. Most groups without insurance usually cost $30 per session. If you’d like a more detailed estimate of what group therapy may cost you, give us a call, and we will be happy to let you know. </p></div></details></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
